  "name": "SXTsq 5 ax",
  "title": "SXTsq 5 ax",
  "title_extended": "SXTsq 5 ax",
  "short_description": "A compact outdoor Wi-Fi 6 CPE with a powerful 16 dBi antenna, AP mode, and multiple mounting options – perfect for masts, poles, or rooftop deployments.",
  "description": "A compact outdoor Wi-Fi 6 CPE with a powerful 16 dBi antenna, AP mode, and multiple mounting options – perfect for masts, poles, or rooftop deployments.",
  "detailed_description": [
    {
      "heading": "Highlights",
      "text": "Modern Dual-core ARM CPU · Gbit ethernet + PoE Input · 5 GHz Wi-Fi 6 · 16 dBi antenna gain",
      "tab": "overview",
      "features": [
        {
          "label": "Modern Dual-core ARM CPU",
          "title": "Modern Dual-core ARM CPU"
        },
        {
          "label": "Gbit ethernet + PoE Input",
          "title": "Gbit ethernet + PoE Input"
        },
        {
          "label": "5 GHz Wi-Fi 6",
          "title": "5 GHz Wi-Fi 6"
        },
        {
          "label": "16 dBi antenna gain",
          "title": "16 dBi antenna gain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Video",
      "text": "",
      "tab": "overview",
      "videos": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9dfsPsCs3Wc",
          "type": "youtube",
          "poster": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/9dfsPsCs3Wc/maxresdefault.webp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Your favorite outdoor CPE",
      "text": "",
      "tab": "overview"
    },
    {
      "heading": "now with Wi-Fi 6 and Access Point mode!",
      "text": "Meet the SXTsq 5 ax — our first Wi-Fi 6 outdoor CPE, combining the best wireless technology with our trusted, compact SXTsq form factor.\n\nPair a mANTBox ax 15s as your uplink with several SXTsq 5 ax units - and you've got everything you need to become the village ISP! No need to wait for large ISPs to reach you.\n\nWith RouterOS license level 4, the SXTsq 5 ax isn’t just a client — it can also be configured as a powerful access point, giving you more flexibility in planning your wireless infrastructure. And thanks to its compact square shape, it fits neatly into even the most space-sensitive deployments.",
      "tab": "overview",
      "media": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.mikrotik.com/web-assets/website/assets/images/SXTsq_5_ax_example_dark.webp",
          "alt": "now with Wi-Fi 6 and Access Point mode!",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 0
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.mikrotik.com/web-assets/website/assets/images/SXTsq_5_ax_table.webp",
          "alt": "now with Wi-Fi 6 and Access Point mode!",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Your favorite outdoor CPE",
      "text": "",
      "tab": "overview"
    },
    {
      "heading": "now with Wi-Fi 6 and Access Point mode!",
      "text": "Meet the SXTsq 5 ax — our first Wi-Fi 6 outdoor CPE, combining the best wireless technology with our trusted, compact SXTsq form factor.\n\nPair a mANTBox ax 15s as your uplink with several SXTsq 5 ax units - and you've got everything you need to become the village ISP! No need to wait for large ISPs to reach you.\n\nWith RouterOS license level 4, the SXTsq 5 ax isn’t just a client — it can also be configured as a powerful access point, giving you more flexibility in planning your wireless infrastructure. And thanks to its compact square shape, it fits neatly into even the most space-sensitive deployments.",
      "tab": "overview",
      "media": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.mikrotik.com/web-assets/website/assets/images/SXTsq_5_ax_example_dark.webp",
          "alt": "now with Wi-Fi 6 and Access Point mode!",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 0
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.mikrotik.com/web-assets/website/assets/images/SXTsq_5_ax_table.webp",
          "alt": "now with Wi-Fi 6 and Access Point mode!",
          "width": 0,
          "height": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Features",
      "text": "",
      "tab": "overview",
      "features": [
        {
          "title": "ARM dual-core + Wi-Fi 6",
          "description": "Despite the upgrade to Wi-Fi 6 and a modern ARM-based dual-core CPU, this unit keeps the same price point as our previous Wi-Fi 5 model — making it one of the best-value weatherproof CPEs on the market.",
          "label": "ARM dual-core + Wi-Fi 6"
        },
        {
          "title": "Weatherproof",
          "description": "The enclosure can withstand all sorts of unpredictable weather hazards, and it features slots for directly attaching a hose clamp in three different mounting positions, including support for horizontal railings — ideal for masts and poles in rooftop or tower deployments.",
          "label": "Weatherproof"
        },
        {
          "title": "3 to 10+ km",
          "description": "Field-tested up to 3 km in high-interference, urban scenarios. Designed with the same trusted long-range architecture as previous SXT models — capable of 10+ km links in line-of-sight deployments.",
          "label": "3 to 10+ km"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Note",
      "text": "The device has an operating system preinstalled and licensed. No separate purchase is necessary and the product is ready to use. The device includes free software updates for the life of the product or a minimum of 5 years starting from date of purchase.",
      "tab": "overview"
    }
  ],
